    "H2 failed because it conflated source type with functional role and then changed sidecar count buckets by channel name.",
    "BIDS 1.7.0 source count reconciliation must operate on the exact declared channel type before any functional mapping.",
    "A familiar HEOG VEOG or Trigger name may assign a nonpredictive functional role without rewriting a source MISC declaration.",
    "The dataset-pinned BIDS version controls sidecar field spelling; a newer specification cannot be applied silently.",
    "The stable 26-channel EEG core and complete geometry can support one future prospective reader after synthetic qualification and a new real-content gate."
